{"title":"Career Roadmap · Arbitration Associate","role":"Arbitration Associate","summary":"An Arbitration Associate assists clients and senior lawyers in resolving commercial and investment disputes through arbitration rather than ordinary court litigation.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"International Law"},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract"},{"text":"Jurisdiction"},{"text":"Legal issues"},{"text":"Tribunal reasoning"},{"text":"Award"},{"text":"Enforcement/challenge"}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Arbitration Associate assists clients and senior lawyers in resolving commercial and investment disputes through arbitration rather than ordinary court litigation."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Commercial law"},{"text":"Civil procedure"},{"text":"Arbitration law"},{"text":"International law"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Legal drafting"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Cross-border dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Arbitration associates may work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Arbitration law firms"},{"text":"International law firms"},{"text":"Dispute-resolution teams"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"Arbitration institutions"},{"text":"Government legal departments"},{"text":"Infrastructure and construction companies"},{"text":"Energy and natural-resources companies"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"International organizations"},{"text":"The field can include domestic arbitration, international commercial arbitration and, depending on specialization, investment arbitration."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / Integrated Law Degree","International + Commercial Law","Arbitration / Dispute Resolutio