bitrators"},{"text":"Jurisdiction"},{"text":"Seat and venue"},{"text":"Interim measures"},{"text":"Arbitral procedure"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Hearings"},{"text":"Awards"},{"text":"Challenge to awards"},{"text":"Enforcement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Treaties"},{"text":"State responsibility"},{"text":"Jurisdiction"},{"text":"International dispute resolution"},{"text":"Cross-border transactions"},{"text":"International commercial law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Arbitration Institutions"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of major arbitration frameworks and institutions, including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UNCITRAL"},{"text":"ICC"},{"text":"SIAC"},{"text":"LCIA"},{"text":"HKIAC"},{"text":"ICSID"},{"text":"Students should understand the purpose and procedural role of these institutions rather than simply memorizing their names."}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Arbitration Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on practical dispute resolution."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to Prepare"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statement of claim"},{"text":"Statement of defence"},{"text":"Counterclaims"},{"text":"Procedural applications"},{"text":"Written submissions"},{"text":"Memorials"},{"text":"Witness statements"},{"text":"Expert submissions"},{"text":"Chronologies"},{"text":"Document bundles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Arbitration Hearing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Dispute","Arbitration Agreement","Notice / Commencement","Tribunal Formation","Pleadings","Document Production","Witness / Expert Evidence","Hearing","Written Submissions","Arbitral Award","Challenge / Enforcement"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Required Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Arbitration"},{"text":"Procedure, jurisdiction, awards"}],[{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Interpretation and breach"}],[{"text":"Commercial Law"},{"text":"Business transactions"}],[{"text":"International Law"},{"text":"Cross-border legal principles"}],[{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Statutes, cases, awards"}],[{"text":"Drafting"},{"text":"Pleadings, memorials, submissions"}],[{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Documentary, witness, expert evidence"}],[{"text":"Advocacy"},{"text":"Oral submissions"}],[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Settlement and dispute strategy"}],[{"text":"Case Management"},{"text":"Deadlines, documents, hearings"}],[{"text":"Legal Writing"},{"text":"Structured argument"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"E-discovery, document management"}],[{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Commercial understanding"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Client and counsel coordination"}]]}]},{"heading":"Arbitration Case Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Commercial Dispute","Review Contract","Identify Arbitration Clause","Determine Jurisdiction","Notice / Commencement","Tribunal Constitution","Procedural Timetable","Statement of Claim","Statement of Defence","Document Production","Witness / Expert Evidence","Hearing","Written Submissions","Arbitral Award","Challenge / Enforcement"]},{"type":"p","text":"An associate may work on multiple stages simultaneously depending on the case."}]},{"heading":"Arbitration Agreement","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the first things an arbitration lawyer examines is the arbitration clause."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Whether an arbitration agreement exists"},{"text":"Scope of the clause"},{"text":"Parties bound by it"},{"text":"Seat"},{"text":"Venue"},{"text":"Governing law"},{"text":"Applicable institutional rules"},{"text":"Number and appointment of arbitrators"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Notice requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example Analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Contract","Arbitration Clause","Who is Bound?","What Disputes Are Covered