":"flow","items":["LLB","International + Commercial Law","Arbitration & Dispute-Resolution Internships","Moot/Mock Arbitration","Junior Dispute Resolution Role","Arbitration Associate","Senior Arbitration Associate","Counsel / Arbitration Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest profile is Law + Arbitration + Commercial Understanding + Excellent Legal Research & Drafting + Advocacy. Students should start building arbitration experience during LLB through internships, commercial-law research, arbitration moots and practical drafting, rather than waiting until after graduation to enter the field."}]}]}